      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Plenty of win chances. DANIHER (6) won two on end before drifting back to last and storming home here to just miss last time. Freshened since. Looks hard to hold out. LUSKIN HERO (2) was a winner here two back then safely held in open class latest. Back in grade and off the low draw will take catching. BAHAMA BAY (1) raced on speed and scored here last time over 1400m. Back in trip but going well and will be tough to stop. BRAT (4) is flying, having won three of his last four runs. Tackling tougher company but hard to knock and with a big weight drop will be in this up front for a long way. BOY BIG (3) lines up for the first time since April 25. Closed the last campaign in lukewarm fashion. Can contest for a place fresh.",
